 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He was a good horse.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He was mine.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "My third horse here, but the best of the three. The first I bought here with my own coin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "This land is not kind on horses. Not kind on men either.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "How long have we been here?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "Four monsoons since we washed up on this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not bleed on my courtyard.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You look worse than the Dutch. At least they had the sense to collapse on sand, not good stone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Sand is softer. Stone holds the bruise longer.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Who wrapped this?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "A Maratha who has tied more saddle girths than ribs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This kingdom keeps trying to turn you into ash.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not give it all of you at once.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I promised your Nagas I would bleed on their earth. I did not promise how much.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Learn to keep a little for yourself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And for those who will have to live with whatever is left.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You are not sleeping.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Neither are you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini told me you wake screaming. That you call out names she does not recognize.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini talks too much.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini loves you. That is why she told me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I lost a husband. At the battle of the lagoon, five years before you washed up on this coast.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "He was a fool who charged when he should have waited.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I watched from the walls. I saw his horse go down. I saw what they did to him after.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "For a year I did not sleep. I would close my eyes and see his face. Not the living face. The one they left in the mud.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "How did it stop?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "It did not stop. I learned to carry it. The way you learn to walk with a stone in your shoe. Eventually, you forget you are limping.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I did not come here to talk about the dead.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Why did you come?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Because you are alive. And so am I.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And I am tired of pretending that is not worth something.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Revathi...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "There is a room below the granary. Padmini showed me, years ago. It kept someone alive once, when knives were hunting.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "No one goes there now. No one will hear.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If anyone sees you leave...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I am a widow. I am not a wife. What I do with my nights is my own concern.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I have thought about this. Since the night you stood in my hall and told me you were not a man who made promises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "I have thought about what it would mean to want someone who might die in any season's campaign.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And I decided that I would rather have one night I chose than a lifetime of nights I did not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini will know.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini knew before I did. Why do you think she showed me this room?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That woman sees too much.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "She sees what she needs to see. And she decides what to remember.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This changes nothing. You are still a mercenary with no name and no house. I am still a princess with a dead husband and a living reputation to protect.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "We will not speak of this in daylight.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And the next time?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "The next time, you will have to earn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Make this parapet straight, and a cannonball will punch through. Slope it, and the ball glances off.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "You save stone. You save men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "MASON"
   ],
   "text": "Stone likes to sit square.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "So do men. We will teach them both new habits.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Again. Prime, load, aim, fire. Faster. Together.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "The ball does not care whose fingers poured the powder if the timing is wrong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Again. Circle, feint, scatter, reform. Feel the sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "megha",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Your cavalry should form in deeper blocks. Their weight will punch through any line.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And present a thicker target for cannon.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Shock matters.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "So does survival. These men have fields to return to when the wet season comes. If you burn them all in one summer, who will plant your pepper?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "You are stubborn.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are surprised?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "No. You are a horseman. I would worry if you were not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We will not wait for the Dutch to bring their friends here. We have other enemies in this land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "The Mysore men. The old chiefs who resent my line. Riders from Madurai, if they decide to come south.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "This army is not only for white men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If we are to face them, let them see that we can stand in their order as well as our own.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We are not Dutch.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will not dress like a Company clerk in boots.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Cloth does not decide who you serve. These coats make European eyes see an army, not a crowd.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Wear them when the Maharaja asks. Throw them aside when you ride home.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king buys loyalty with guns. It is an expensive currency. When the guns rust, what will hold them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Habit. Fear. Pride.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Habit breaks. Fear changes its object.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Pride is a fire that burns houses as easily as enemy camps.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You could go back. You have earned the right. The king would not stop you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And then what? They will either treat me as a curiosity or try to use me against this land.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Either way, I will find myself in another man's web. At least here I know the strands.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You speak as if you are resigned.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I speak as if I have counted. And found fewer deaths in this column than in the others.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-06",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "Always counting.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-06",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It is what I know how to do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Why did you cross? Before the battle ended. Before you knew we would win.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You walked away from your own men.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Arras. Do you know it?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "A Catholic city in Flanders. Yet I served a Protestant company, under officers who thought my faith one step above devil worship.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "They tolerated me because I could build walls and aim cannon. They never trusted me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That alone would not make a man desert.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "No. But seventeen years of watching the Company grind men into numbers does.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The Company paid them late or not at all. The officers drank wine while the soldiers ate weevils.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I wrote reports. No one read them.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Then they sent me here. To take a beach and wait for reinforcements that were never coming.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "We were a gesture, not an army. A message written in men's lives.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I decided I was tired of being a number in someone else's ledger.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "I am forty-three. No wife, no children, no land waiting in Europe.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "When I was a boy, I dreamed of building fortresses on foreign shores.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "None of us drew the people who would live behind those walls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Now I build walls for a king who once tried to kill me. But at least I build.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are still an entry. Ramayyan has you in his ledgers too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. But he pays me. On time. In my hand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "My mother lights candles for a son who is either dead or damned, depending on which story the priests tell that week.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY (off)"
   ],
   "text": "I do not know which pains her less.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "Do you ever regret staying?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Regret. No. Question, yes. Often.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "That is something.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Down!",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Not our men. Dutch agents, perhaps. Or some Kochi fool who thinks the Company will pat his head.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "It pleases me that they aimed badly. It troubles me that they aimed at all.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "They will try again, in other ways.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You will walk with Kappittan Lannoy. You will walk with Sawant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Wherever they go, you are their shadow.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-23-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "They will come back. My old masters. They do not like being told no.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-23-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then we will have walls ready for them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-23-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "And guns. And horse. And men who know how to move on sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  }
 ]
}